# The image holds the code and nothing else. Company and person data, the
# secrets and the profile are mounted at run time (compose.yaml), so an image
# can be built, shared or pushed without carrying any of them.
/data/
.env
profile.toml
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/
docs/milestones/

.git/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
